  'add-to-array-form-of-integer': `
def addToArrayForm(num, k):
    num = list(num.to_py() if hasattr(num, 'to_py') else num)
    i = len(num) - 1
    carry = k
    while i >= 0 or carry > 0:
        digit = carry % 10
        carry //= 10
        if i >= 0:
            s = num[i] + digit
            num[i] = s % 10
            carry += s // 10
            i -= 1
        else:
            num.insert(0, digit)
    return num
`,

